	The Australia Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - CN" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type                | Is     | Create                      |
	| SLA                        | Is     | Platinum                    |
	| Priority                   | Is     | High                        |
	| Within (schedule)          | Is     | JP - Schedule               |
	| Support Region             | Is     | Australia                   |
	| Partner First Line Support | Is     | false                       |
	| Product                    | Is not | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product                    | Is not | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - AU" should have "8" conditions
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - AU" should assign the ticket to the "group" "CSE - AU - Platinum Critical"

Scenario: Assign to Platinum Critical HU
	The Hungary Platinum Critical trigger should be properly set

	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - HU" should have the following properties under the all conditions
	| Update Type                | Is     | Create                      |
	| SLA                        | Is     | Platinum                    |
	| Priority                   | Is     | High                        |
	| Support Region             | Is not | Brazil                      |
	| Support Region             | Is not | Spain                       |
	| Support Region             | Is not | Japan                       |
	| Partner First Line Support | Is     | false                       |
	| Product                    | Is not | prd_liferay_analytics_cloud |
	| Product                    | Is not | prd_liferay_dxp_cloud       |
	* the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - HU" should have the following properties under the any conditions
	| Within (schedule) | Is | HU - Schedule         |
	| Within (schedule) | Is | HU - Weekend Schedule |
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - HU" should have "11" conditions
	And the trigger "Assign to Platinum Critical - HU" should assign the ticket to the "group" "CSE - HU - Platinum Critical"

